[h1]Bug Reports & Feedback[/h1]
Report problems in Workshop discussions (preferred) or QQ group 609823795.
Describe expected versus actual behavior and steps to reproduce.
In Settings, choose [b]Seedline diagnostics → Export[/b] and send the generated ZIP privately to the maintainer.
If export is unavailable, open [b]%APPDATA%\SlayTheSpire2[/b] with Win+R and copy [b]logs[/b] plus the affected profile's [b]current_run.save[/b] and [b]current_run.save.backup[/b] (if present) from [b]steam\<SteamID>\modded\profileN\saves[/b] to a separate folder before relaunching, then ZIP it for private sharing.
